  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中國哲學專題",
    "sub_ename": "TOPICS IN CHINESE PHILOSOPHY",
    "describe_ch": "哲學思想是文化的根基。中國哲學強調由道德實踐而證成真理，不遺理智思辨而超越理智思辨。其中儒道佛三家思想，更是深入華人的生活世界中。本課程將以三家思想為核心對中國哲學的內容與特質進行理解。",
    "describe_eh": "Philosophical ideas are the foundation of culture. Chinese philosophy emphasizes that truth is established through moral practice, and it goes beyond intellectual reasoning. The philosophies of Confucianism, Taoism, and Buddhism have deeply influenced the lives of Chinese people. This course will focus on these three schools of thought to enhance students’ understanding of the content and characteristics of Chinese philosophy.",
